# Naming conventions

## Variables

- No single-letter names except `i`, `j` in loops and `x`, `y`, `z` in geometry.
- Hook results: descriptive names (`flowMode`, `activeDiagram`), not `m`, `d`.
- Discriminated extractions: name by meaning (`recordingState`, `playbackState`), not `rec`, `playing`.
- Forbidden single-letter names: `m`, `r`, `d`, `p`, `s`, `c`, `n`, `v`, `e` (except in `catch`).

## Functions

- Booleans: `is*`, `has*`, `can*`, `should*`.
- Handlers: `handle*` in definitions, `on*` on props.
- Avoid abbreviations: `connection` not `conn`, `diagram` not `diag`.

## File names

- Components: PascalCase (`FlowRecorderPanel.tsx`).
- Hooks: `use` + camelCase (`useCanvasNodes.ts`).
- Utils / types / constants: camelCase (`scene.utils.ts`, `diagram.types.ts`, `canvas.constants.ts`).
